TI  - Hate crime laws rarely used by Australian authorities, police figures reveal
T2  - ABC News
AB  - Investigative piece on the near-total failure to prosecute hate crimes under Australian law. Only 21 convictions under hate crime laws in Australia ever; zero in NSW since records began in 1994. US expert Matt Browning: Australian police had "heads in the sand."
