AB  - ABC Radio Sydney Sunday Brunch. Historian and 78er Garry Wotherspoon interviewed at his Oxford Street home the morning after Mardi Gras 2024. Covers Oxford Street as "the ghetto," its formation through the HIV/AIDS era, and the social geography of gay Sydney: beats, venues, community spaces. Primary-quality oral history from a first-hand witness.
